### IntelliJ IDEA Ultimate: click the green arrow next to a request to send it.
### In other editions, send the same requests with Postman.

### Hello World
GET http://localhost:8080/hello

### Hello with a name
GET http://localhost:8080/hello/Rahim

### Get all students
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students

### Get one student
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/1

### Create a student
POST http://localhost:8080/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Nusrat Jahan", "cgpa": 3.66 }

### Update student 1
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/students/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Rahim Uddin", "cgpa": 3.80 }

### Delete student 1
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/students/1

### Search by name
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/search?name=ra

### Top students (cgpa >= 3.7)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/top?minCgpa=3.7

### Invalid data: expect 400 Bad Request with error messages
POST http://localhost:8080/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "", "cgpa": 9.5 }

### Not found: expect 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/999
